                <p rendition="#center">THE BLOCKADE FARCE</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Increase in Germany’s Imports—The Navy Crippled by
                        Foreign Office—Startling American Trade Figures</hi>
                </p>
